Subject: [PATCH 3/4] remotes: bound OCI referrers traversal

Follow bounded same-origin OCI Referrers API pagination, preserve query filters and repository scope, retain native registry failures across fallback-tag attempts, continue eligible fallback hosts, and keep descriptor, page, decoded-byte, and first-page resource-limit failures fatal rather than classifying them as absence.

